        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "First, we seek to provide opportunities to small and minority vendors to compete for work with our company, which also helps to expand our vendor base and ensure we are getting the most value, quality and benefit from the money we spend on products and services.",
